 wishes it was. From the creature diversity, the crafting system, the perks and powers of pals. everything is great. if i really had to nitpick (and I mean really have to) sometimes it annoying to deal with an occasional glitch and inventory management. but these are my ONLY complaints. Excellent example of what games should be and cost in this day and age.", "timestamp_created": 1786145790, "timestamp_updated": 1786145790, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31849", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 7950X3D 16-Core Processor          ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER", "vram_size": 16045}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232305611", "author": {"steamid": "76561199230720316", "personaname": "dreddmark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199230720316/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3845, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 70, "playtime_at_review": 2031, "last_played": 1790437188, "avatar": "21aac2891963f43a3ed3a2aedf12ab915c5dae69"}, "language": "english", "review": "If Ark and Pokemon had a baby, great game with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1786145281, "timestamp_updated": 1786145281, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232305293", "author": {"steamid": "76561198993356545", "personaname": "Super Dude", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198993356545/", "num_games_own